OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdamp and cloudy overnight, with rain
OL,7,Fsteadily easing by morning. Breezy
OL,8,Falong southern coasts. A milder night
OL,9,Fthan Monday night for most but patchy
OL,10,Fgrass frost in northern areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAfter a wet and cloudy
OL,13,Fstart, turning brighter for most on
OL,14,FWednesday, with low cloud over central
OL,15,Fareas. Daytime temperatures near
OL,16,Fnormal but a cold night ahead with
OL,17,Fwidespread frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
