OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FWidespread frost and patchy fog to
OL,7,Fstart Thursday, but dry and bright
OL,8,Fafter this and into the weekend. Cold
OL,9,Ffor the time of year with brisk winds
OL,10,Fwhich ease later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
